  "notes": "Shadcn-like admin aesthetic in Geist. KPI tiles each get a distinct pastel tint (mint, sky, butter, lavender) with a thin matching border and a rounded square icon chip in the top right; the same tinted icon-chip motif repeats in every widget header (Recent Orders, Top Products, Price exceptions, Top Staff...). Large radii (18px panels, 14px controls), electric blue #3248ff primary for Close day button, active nav and View all links. Segmented period control uses a black pill for the selected option. Order statuses are coloured text without pills, while metric annotations use soft pill chips with arrow icons. Footer is an IDE-like status bar (printer connection, shift state, diagnostics)."
